flowchart TD
 A[Concern or urgent request] --> B[Separate facts from fears]
 B --> C{Payment or identity request?}
 C -- Yes --> D[Pause and use independently trusted channel]
 D --> E{Verification sufficient?}
 E -- No --> F[Keep action paused]
 E -- Yes --> G[Human decision under normal safeguards]
 C -- No --> H[Choose one seven-day reversible action]
 H --> I[Observable completion check]
 I --> J[Review limits and next step]
